In addition, please note that we may process Personal Data in each of the above categories in order to protect the rights of Tubi and others, and/or to complete a merger or sale of assets or other corporate transaction. For more details about our purposes for processing, including how other parties may process Personal Data, please see the Use and Disclosure section above.
We do not use automated processing technology to make decisions about individuals that produce legal or similarly significant effects.
Please note that the definition of “sale” varies under state privacy laws. For example, under the Virginia Law and other similar state privacy laws, the definition of “sale” is the exchange of Personal Data for monetary consideration. We do not “sell” Personal Data as defined under those laws. However, we and our advertising partners use certain Personal Data to deliver online advertisements to you on your devices tailored to your interests, which could be considered “selling” under other state privacy laws (e.g., Colorado, Connecticut, Oregon).
State privacy laws’ definitions of “sale,” however, do not include the transfer of Personal Data as an asset that is part of a merger, bankruptcy, or other similar transaction involving all or any portion of our business.
As explained, depending on the consumer’s interactions with us, Tubi may not have collected, disclosed, processed for purposes of targeted advertising, and/or “sold,” each (or any) of these categories, of Personal Data for each listed purpose. In addition, we do not engage in “profiling” in furtherance of decisions that produce a legal or similarly significant effect.
Sensitive Personal Information
. Under limited circumstances, we may process Personal Data defined as “sensitive personal information” under state laws in connection with the Tubi Services for purposes allowed by applicable law (i.e., for the purposes enumerated in applicable state laws, such as when processing the data is needed to comply with the law). In certain states, “sensitive personal information” may include data collected from a user defined as a “child” under local laws. Please see Section 6, above, for our children’s privacy notice.
